	<section_number>37.2-714.1</section_number>
	<catch_line>State facilities; video visitation</catch_line>
	<text>
		The director of every state facility shall establish a process to facilitate virtual visitation through the use of audio and video equipment for individuals receiving services at the state facility.
	</text>
	<history>2022, c. 295.</history>
